{
  "info": {
    "name": "07 — Phase 3.3.1–3.3.2 Manager/Mentor Materials",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Manager typed draft CRUD and assigned Mentor context/draft/submit. Login cookie jar; mutations require Origin matching CORS_ORIGINS. Choose class_id; units returns class_unit_id/course_unit_id and sessions returns session_id. Upload own Files 3.2 assets in current assignment and wait READY. Manager decisions/release and ARTICLE assets/binary preview remain later slices. Conflict: refetch and compare before any new mutation. Local verified; VPS acceptance pending."
  },
